Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've now arrived at 47th cruise station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please check all of your belongings\Nbefore departing the C train.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to take it, I'll\Ngive it to you for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're a real swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This year's Aqua Laguna did\Na real number on the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's giving it their best, but I\Ndon't think we can repair this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Polly from Doc 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here on the back streets?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to work, Doc Clay. Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc 3, I'm leaving this\Nside of the bridge to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc 5, you get started with the\Nhouses next to Scrap Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we still gotta do our day jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I want to see this whole town in\Ntip-top shape by the end of the month!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:02:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love you, Kelly Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never let us down.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:06.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\bord2.25\xshad-0.25\yshad-0.25\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1065,0)\t(1023,1065,\1a&H00&)}Remains of the Franky House, North Shore
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.66,0:03:06.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1065,0)}Remains of the Franky House, North Shore
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Building stuff sure is hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit, we're a lot\Nbetter at breaking things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we're sleeping outdoors again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little rest and\Nyou'll be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reindeer said Gamora's eyesight should\Nreturn if he takes it easy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? That's great.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.03,0:03:45.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\bord2.25\xshad-0.25\yshad-0.25\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1022,0)\t(980,1022,\1a&H00&)}Dock One, Shipyard Island
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.03,0:03:45.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1022,0)}Dock One, Shipyard Island
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let us meet the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to apologize for\Ntreating them so bad before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats aren't\Nmeeting with anyone today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our company prepared\Nthem a thank you package.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least let us give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with Water 7 News.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I please get a comment with\Nthe heroes who saved the mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're busy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:03:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the secretary to replace Kalifa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this where you wanted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's perfect, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish we had you guys around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kind of stuff is a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you got more, then bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making everyone\Nelse look bad, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sniper King,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you, sure you're happy here? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we were just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our bosses are still fighting\Nlike you said they were,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no point in us joining up\Nwith them until it's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll stick around here and\Nhelp out while they need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after that, we plan\Nto head back to Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long story short, you want\Nto come along with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:04:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.70,0:05:04.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,710)\fnRoboto\bord2.25\xshad-0.25\yshad-0.25\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1019,0)\t(977,1019,\1a&H00&)}Remains of the Galley-La Company Headquarters\NIceberg's Residence
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.70,0:05:04.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,710)\fnRoboto\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1019,0)}Remains of the Galley-La Company Headquarters\NIceberg's Residence
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.20,0:05:10.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\bord2.25\xshad-0.25\yshad-0.25\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1064,0)\t(1022,1064,\1a&H00&)}{Temporary Headquarters Building - CR}Temporary HQ{Z - "building" would be redundant when HQ is already synonymous with being a structure}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.20,0:05:10.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\fnRoboto\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1064,0)}{Temporary Headquarters Building - CR}Temporary HQ{Z - "building" would be redundant when HQ is already synonymous with being a structure}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in the end, you burned the blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made yourself an\Nenemy of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so. Spill it. What are\Nyou so busy drawing over there, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna was powerful This year\Ni'm sure it's weighing on everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minds it may not be long before\Nthis island is completely swallowed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by the sea so what's the plan\Ni'm going to make this city float
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make Water 7 a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that's even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We grew up watching a man who\Ncould make the impossible possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a man, show some gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did always do everything\Nwith a bang, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that you, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Aokiji. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It finally came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're picking it up here at\Nthe train station as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your 200 million buried treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is gonna be sweet.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.66,0:06:31.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,710)\fnRoboto\bord2.25\xshad-0.25\yshad-0.25\fscx110\fscy110\b600\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\fad(1018,0)\t(977,1018,\1a&H00&)}{Special Pirate Room with Kitchen and Bathroom,\NTemporary Headquarters Building - CR}Pirate Annex with Kitchen and Bathroom\NTemporary HQ{Z - For typesetter: "special room" would either be "guest quarters" or "annex" based on context. the pirates are guests, but they're also outlaws and on the DL, so probably annex? Up to you if it's too localized... we can easily go back to "special pirate room"}{more even line = better (Gab)}
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.66,0:06:31.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,710)\fnRoboto\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\blur0.8\c&HFDFDFC&\fad(1018,0)}{Special Pirate Room with Kitchen and Bathroom,\NTemporary Headquarters Building - CR}Pirate Annex with Kitchen and Bathroom\NTemporary HQ{Z - For typesetter: "special room" would either be "guest quarters" or "annex" based on context. the pirates are guests, but they're also outlaws and on the DL, so probably annex? Up to you if it's too localized... we can easily go back to "special pirate room"}{more even lines = better (Gab)}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope everyone's decent. Oh, hey, Kokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, we're coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'd better wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys have been sleeping for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been awfully pooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you\Nafter all that fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate King is back on his feet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, actually, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he couldn't\Nmove after the last fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he didn't want to miss dinner\Nbecause he was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he developed the sleep-eating\Ntechnique you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's so cool! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you call multi-talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, your Log Pose should be\Nset after another two or three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the Log Pose is set, it's not\Nlike we can go anywhere without a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the money we saved up to\Nbuy a new ship is gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:08:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our clothes, furniture, Even Bellamere's\Nprecious tangerine trees were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna carried it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so depressed, I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We left our stuff in one\Nof the Backstreet Hotels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's what your\Nguests are here about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I thought\NI'd never see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about kicking you out, but we\Nthought you tried to assassinate Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We treated your belongings as pirate\Nloot, so we confiscated everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper reporting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm great now that you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a heavy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I treated the Franky family's wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I didn't let Robin out of\Nmy sight for a single second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you,\NI'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my word, soldier. Guys, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My tangerine trees are okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got our money back and our stuff, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we buy a ship, then\Nwe'll be good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys feeling super? Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, some folks aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the big entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, better listen close, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, there's this island\Nthat's always at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're here to tell bedtime\Nstories, go bother someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For years, fire has rained on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death and destruction are the\Nonly things that its people know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Houses burn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cities fall to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place to\Nrun from all the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the midst of all this madness\Nthere's a single tree. No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happens it never falls and no matter how\Nmuch the island is destroyed its people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather around it and build it all up\Nagain it's the strongest tree in the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,World as far as anyone knows only a few
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exist it's known as the jewel tree Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every so often a piece of wood from\Nthat tree shows up on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've wanted one for a long time now, but\Nthe going price is 200 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too expensive for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until a bunch of pirates\Nshowed up flailing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their money around and\Nbegging me to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You used our money to buy some stupid\Nlog and then you brag about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, I decided that I was done\Nbuilding ships for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:11:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I couldn't help but follow\Nin the footsteps of my old master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon enough, I found\Nmyself designing a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, my hope is to use that\Nspecial wood to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put all my heart into one last ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship of dreams that\Ncan sail across any sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had the blueprints for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I finally have the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what I'm saying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it would be my honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd take my ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sail the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give us\Nthe ship free of charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, cause that way I'll know\Nmy masterpiece is in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, that's all I could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that, and you kinda\Npaid for it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger is the only man in history\Nwho's sailed across the whole world,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his ship, the Otto Jackson, was\Nmade from a jeweled tree as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the best\Ndamn ship you've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a shipwright after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can pretend all you like, but in the\Nend, you're just like old Tom, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think I finally understand\Nthe pride Tom felt when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Franky! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to take your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, on to the next island!\NBoopies! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a new ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think those bastards\Nwould come after us so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I bet Luffy's\Nstill sleeping, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta warn him before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here to arrest the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after they save the mayor's\Nlife, they won't show them any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you see that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Vice Admiral Garp's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight from headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you say Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same Garp that nearly captured\NGold Roger over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not messing\Naround if they send him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they don't run, those\Npirates are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You new around town? Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only person here is our president, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding those pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, you two. Wait here. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but are you\Nfolks the Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I have some friends here that\Nwould like to share our word with Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never learns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as careless as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! That hurt! No! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would one little\Npunch hurt you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're made of robber!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because there is no\Ndefense against a fist of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been getting in a lot\Nof trouble lately, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you owe me an apology, boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.91,0:16:18.87,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,640)\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord2.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(436,0)\t(395,436,\1a&H00&)}{Vice Admiral Monkey D. Garp\N"Garp the Fist"\NMarine HQ}{Alt: <Monkey D Garp\N"Garp the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ> ... We could also make it more readable like this: <Monkey D. Garp "the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ>}Monkey D. Garp "the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ
Dialogue: 2,0:16:15.91,0:16:18.87,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,640)\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\c&HFCFDFD&\blur0.8\fad(436,0)}{Vice Admiral Monkey D. Garp\N"Garp the Fist"\NMarine HQ}{Alt: <Monkey D Garp\N"Garp the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ> ... We could also make it more readable like this: <Monkey D. Garp "the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ>}Monkey D. Garp "the Fist"\NVice Admiral, Marine HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been up to no good. Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't that the name of the Navy\Nhero that fought against Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, is this Navy guy\Nreally your grandpa? Sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, don't try to fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll kill you, just like he almost\Nkilled me over and over when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give them the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I admit, I did throw\Nyou into a ravine that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I left you in the\Njungle a few times, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sure, there were those times I\Nsent you sailing on those balloons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't do it to kill\Nyou I did it to make you a man
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see. So this is where all of\NLuffy's endurance comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is why everything rolls\Noff when I left you an Ace with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friend for training I thought\Neverything would work out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fine but I turned my back and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you end up like this I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make you into a navy man\Nyou stinking ingrate how the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heck did you become a criminal\NI told you a million times I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wanted to be a pirate it's not\Nmy fault you wouldn't listen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all that damn Red\NHat's fault, the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even be alive if\Nit wasn't for Saints! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that any way to speak to your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are all dead for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A captain's been captured by the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! No! This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we try to help Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then all those Marines outside\Nare gonna rush in and attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, so wait, what are\Nwe supposed to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in a\Nsituation like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, did I fall asleep again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up and take your lecture like a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare doze off on\Nme when I'm yelling at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't show your grandpa some\Nrespect, I'll have to beat it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to stay out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giri?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's his grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no wonder Luffy\Nnever talked about his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of that red-headed\Npirate friend of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any clue what kind of\Ndangerous business he's involved in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't heard anything\Nabout Shanks in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he okay? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's as many pirates out there\Nas there are stars in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that redhead's one of the brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the same class\Nas Whitebeard, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only four pirates\Nas powerful as that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they rule over the second half\Nof the Grand Line, like kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seven warlords and us folks of\Nthe Navy have allied against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea is to create a balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any one of these three forces\Ngrew stronger than the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the peace we worked so hard to\Nprotect would come crumbling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it,\Nbut I'm glad he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, brings back memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy has connections\Nto red-haired shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where he got his Straw Hat from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shanks asked him to take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was such\Nan important guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over here, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, good luck with the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have tried to mug you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the pirate hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems to be going on\Nsome sort of rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's from Luffy's crew, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, you two. Give him hell. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kokoro knives, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting choice of a\Nweapon you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's OK, we don't need to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that for, you jerk?! Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.38,0:21:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you OK? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys, you're no match at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as tough as I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I give.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Luffy. Hi, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's me. It's Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do have a friend named Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Kobe I know is a\Nwhole lot smaller than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.31,0:21:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the right Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crybaby, good-for-nothing\NKobe from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.36,0:22:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is he on the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not a\Ncommissioned Navy officer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I heard you\Nguys were in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to stop by and say hello\Nwhile I still had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you two, we\Nwouldn't be where we are today.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,725)\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord2.8\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(478,0)\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Sergeant Major Koby\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:19.69,0:22:22.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,725)\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord0\c&HFAFDFD&\blur0.8\fad(478,0)}Sergeant Major Koby\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,725)\fscx110\fscy110\b600\bord2.8\3c&H0E0E11&\c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(482,0)\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Sergeant Helmeppo\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(482,0)\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8\b600\pos(960,725)\c&HFAFDFD&}Sergeant Helmeppo\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.10,0:22:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't go quite that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of stuff happened,\Nbut long story short,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ended up being trained by\NVice Admiral Garp himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, but you grew so much from\Nbefore, I didn't even recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.63,0:22:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Koby I remember was\Na pudgy little dorky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're worn out\Nafter all that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.33,0:22:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:22:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't recognize me at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me! You know me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a clue, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Helmeppo, Captain\NMorgan's son, Helmeppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had you tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were almost executed\Nbecause of me, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.02,0:23:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't possibly\Nforget that, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.34,0:23:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we all know who I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.70,0:23:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.04,0:23:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop giving me such a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.96,0:23:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one likes a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro, you seem\Nto be handling this well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.44,0:23:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made empty threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always talking about my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.94,0:23:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:23:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to forgive\Nthem, but I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.14,0:24:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to accept the\Npast and move on, Helmepo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.48,0:24:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got a job for you boys. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wall, fix it. What? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were going to have us fix it,\Nwhy'd you break it in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because walking through a door\Ndoesn't make much of an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.18,0:24:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only impression you're\Nmaking here is a bad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, we'll fix the wall, but it's\Nyour fault, so you've got to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.36,0:24:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.04,0:24:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this grandpa of yours\Nis really famous. Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never really asked him about his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Luffy, I heard you met\Nyour old man a while back. Huh? My dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think I had a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.74,0:25:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.94,0:25:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd introduce himself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.36,0:25:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, he saw\Nyou off back at Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember what happened, but I\Nsure don't remember Luffy's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you give me a hint here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Dad like?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of your father is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.86,0:25:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon, the revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.12,0:25:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The revolutionary has a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.32,0:25:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he's famous,\NLuffy didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.68,0:26:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, dragon is Vice Admiral Garp's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.56,0:26:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of crazy messed\Nup family have they got?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I never\Nheard Dragon's full name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.60,0:26:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone freaking out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.34,0:26:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to tell me you've\Nnever heard of Dragon before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a dangerous man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.14,0:26:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, really dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.40,0:26:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.84,0:26:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure how\NI should explain this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.60,0:26:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates like us are enemies with the Navy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't usually\Nattack them on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.48,0:26:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is one group that is directly
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.04,0:26:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opposing the authority\Nof the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.84,0:26:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.68,0:26:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man at the head\Nof that group is Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.42,0:26:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now his ideology has spread to many\Nnations causing worldwide rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government's hold has already\Ncollapsed in a number of regions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.26,0:26:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the government is furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've labeled Dragon as\Nthe world's worst criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.02,0:27:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and will stop at absolutely\Nnothing to hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is that no one\Nknows a single thing about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.98,0:27:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's very mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.64,0:27:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.76,0:27:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.50,0:27:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, that was a mistake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.12,0:27:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't\Nhave said all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?

